5,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's keep our discussions logical. I suggest we focus on contradictions in statements and voting patterns to identify the werewolf.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. I believe that if we speak with kindness and honesty, the truth will naturally reveal itself.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Minako. Logical consistency is key. I will be observing everyone's reactions and the flow of the conversation to find any discrepancies.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A most prudent approach. I shall contribute by analyzing the factual data we gather. Let us maintain a polite yet rigorous standard of evidence.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,This sounds like a fun challenge! I'll just be myself and try to help everyone. I'm sure we can figure this out together!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Thank you. @Shizue, while kindness is good, remember that the werewolf will likely act kindly to blend in. We must remain vigilant.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"You are quite right, Minako dear. It is important to be careful. I trust your wisdom to guide us safely.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Exactly. Trust should be earned through consistent behavior, not just a friendly demeanor. I'll be looking for those who try too hard to fit in.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A subtle point, Mizuki. The ""over-performance"" of innocence is often a tell. I look forward to seeing how our baseline of trust evolves.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa, you guys are already acting like detectives! @Mizuki, are you already suspecting someone? I'm just here to make friends!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minako,,"No one is suspected yet, Kenji. We are simply establishing our methodology. Let's ensure we all share our reasoning clearly when the time comes.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Clear communication is the heart of a peaceful community. I shall do my best to be open with you all.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, I'm not suspecting anyone yet. I'm simply setting the criteria for my judgment. I prefer to act on evidence rather than intuition.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. Intuition is a charming tool, but logic is a far more reliable compass in a game of deception. I shall be observing closely.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,Got it! I'll try my best to be clear. I hope we don't accidentally vote out a nice person!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minako,,"We will do our best to avoid that. For now, let's prepare for the first night. I believe we have a solid plan for Day 1.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"I wish you all a peaceful night. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll be analyzing the information we receive tomorrow. Let's stay sharp.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A peaceful night indeed, provided the werewolf is feeling merciful. I shall retire to my thoughts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight everyone! I can't wait to see what happens tomorrow!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
